$MDESC::Text = "\n<s3><>\n<f1>Mission Type :  <f0>Capture the Flag\n<f1>Planet  : <f0>Aurea Borealis\n<f1>Weather  : <f0>Clear\n<f1>Time of Day : <f0>Night\n<f1># of Teams : <f0>2\n<f1>Briefing : You have been called on to the icy planet of Aurea Borealis to stand guard of the flag held in your massive flying base. Try and capture the other teams' flag located across the map to win the game. There is a center objective, claim it and own the skys. First team to win, uhh wins.\n\n<f1>Map Creator : {-o-} Coal\n<f1>E-mail : <f0>CloudConnected22@aol.com\n<f1>DV: V2.0.12";

